Description: Tools for processing and analyzing hyperspectral imaging (HSI) 
    data from line-scanning sensors. Provides radiometric calibration from 
    raw captures to reflectance, spectral smoothing (median, Savitzky-Golay), 
    continuum removal, calculation of spectral indices (RABD, RABA, NDI, 
    ratio, difference), and extraction of spatial profiles and spectra. 
    Designed for large datasets that exceed available memory, using 
    file-backed raster processing via 'terra'.
